<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">T<sup id="id1" class="ltx_sup">2</sup>Agent: A Tool-augmented Multimodal Misinformation Detection Agent with Monte Carlo Tree Search</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname"><span id="id2" class="ltx_text"></span> <span id="id3" class="ltx_text">
<span id="id3.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<span id="id3.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="id3.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_center">Xing Cui  Yueying Zou  Zekun Li  Peipei Li  Xinyuan Xu</span></span>
<span id="id3.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
