</span>
</div>
<div id="algx1.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
              
              
            <span id="algx1.l8.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">      Expand </span><math id="algx1.l8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathsize="0.900em">s</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s</annotation></semantics></math><span id="algx1.l8.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> by generating </span><math id="algx1.l8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathsize="0.900em">n</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n</annotation></semantics></math><span id="algx1.l8.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> new child nodes using </span><math id="algx1.l8.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{LVLM}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">p</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">L</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">V</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">L</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">M</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{LVLM}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="algx1.l8.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
</span>
</div>
<div id="algx1.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
              
              
            <span id="algx1.l9.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">   </span><span id="algx1.l9.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">end</span><span id="algx1.l9.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="algx1.l9.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">if</span>
</div>
<div id="algx1.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
              
              
            <span id="algx1.l10.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">   Select next node </span><math id="algx1.l10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s^{\prime}\in children(s)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">s</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">′</mo></msup><mo mathsize="0.900em">∈</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">h</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">l</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">d</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">s</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s^{\prime}\in children(s)</annotation></semantics></math><span id="algx1.l10.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> using modified UCT:
</span>
</div>
<div id="algx1.l11" class="ltx_listingline">
              
              
            <span id="algx1.l11.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  </span><span id="algx1.l11.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">end</span><span id="algx1.l11.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="algx1.l11.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">while</span>
</div>
<div id="algx1.l12" class="ltx_listingline">
              
              
            <span id="algx1.l12.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  Combine scores: </span><math id="algx1.l12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="V(s)=\alpha S_{t}^{T}+(1-\alpha)S_{t}^{C}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">V</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">s</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">α</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">S</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">T</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">α</mi></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi mathsize="0.900em">S</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">C</mi></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">V(s)=\alpha S_{t}^{T}+(1-\alpha)S_{t}^{C}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="algx1.l12.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="algx1.l12.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;float:right;"><math id="algx1.l12.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Evaluation
</span>
</div>
<div id="algx1.l13" class="ltx_listingline">
              
              
            <span id="algx1.l13.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  </span><span id="algx1.l13.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">for</span><span id="algx1.l13.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><math id="algx1.l13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\leftarrow T-1,\dots,0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">T</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em" mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\leftarrow T-1,\dots,0</annotation></semantics></math><span id="algx1.l13.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="algx1.l13.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">do</span><span id="algx1.l13.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="algx1.l13.8" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;float:right;"><math id="algx1.l13.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Backpropagation
</span>
</div>
<div id="algx1.l14" class="ltx_listingline">
              
              
            <span id="algx1.l14.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">   </span><math id="algx1.l14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="V(s_{t})\leftarrow\frac{V(s_{t})(N(s_{t}))+V(s)}{N(s_{t})+1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">V</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">s</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msub><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">V</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">s</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msub><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">s</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msub><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">V</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">s</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">N</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">s</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">t</mi></msub><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">+</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">V(s_{t})\leftarrow\frac{V(s_{t})(N(s_{t}))+V(s)}{N(s_{t})+1}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="algx1.l14.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
</span>
</div>
<div id="algx1.l15" class="ltx_listingline">
              
              
            <span id="algx1.l15.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  </span><span id="algx1.l15.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">end</span><span id="algx1.l15.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="algx1.l15.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">for</span>
</div>
<div id="algx1.l16" class="ltx_listingline">
              
              
            <span id="algx1.l16.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">end</span><span id="algx1.l16.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="algx1.l16.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">for</span>
</div>
<div id="algx1.l17" class="ltx_listingline">
              
              
            <span id="algx1.l17.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">if</span><span id="algx1.l17.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> Early stop with an answer </span><span id="algx1.l17.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">then</span><span id="algx1.l17.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="algx1.l17.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;float:right;"><math id="algx1.l17.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Decision making
</span>
</div>
<div id="algx1.l18" class="ltx_listingline">
              
              
            <span id="algx1.l18.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  return answer
</span>
</div>
<div id="algx1.l19" class="ltx_listingline">
              
              
            <span id="algx1.l19.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">else</span>
</div>
<div id="algx1.l20" class="ltx_listingline">
              
              
            <span id="algx1.l20.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  </span><math id="algx1.l20.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p(real)=\prod_{i=1}^{n}{\left(1-p\left(\text{fake}^{i}\right)\right)}^{\left(1/n\right)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">l</mi></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" rspace="0em" stretchy="true">∏</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">i</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">n</mi></msubsup><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mo mathsize="0.900em">−</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msup><mtext mathsize="0.900em">fake</mtext><mi mathsize="0.900em">i</mi></msup><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em" stretchy="true" symmetric="true">/</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">n</mi></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p(real)=\prod_{i=1}^{n}{\left(1-p\left(\text{fake}^{i}\right)\right)}^{\left(1/n\right)}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="algx1.l20.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
</span>
</div>
<div id="algx1.l21" class="ltx_listingline">
              
              
            <span id="algx1.l21.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  </span><math id="algx1.l21.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="answer=arg\max\left(p(real),\left\{p(fake^{i})\right\}_{i=1}^{n}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">w</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">r</mi></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">g</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">e</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">l</mi></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo>{</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">p</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">f</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">e</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">i</mi></msup></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">i</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">n</mi></msubsup><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">answer=arg\max\left(p(real),\left\{p(fake^{i})\right\}_{i=1}^{n}\right)</annotation></semantics></math><span id="algx1.l21.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
</span>
</div>
<div id="algx1.l22" class="ltx_listingline">
              
              
            <span id="algx1.l22.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">end</span><span id="algx1.l22.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="algx1.l22.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">if</span>
</div>
</div>
</figure>
<div id="A1.SS2.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Although the full set of tools offers broad functionality, not all tools are equally valuable for every task <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib40" title="" class="ltx_ref">40</a>]</cite>. To balance efficiency and performance, we leverage Bayesian Optimization (BO) to systematically identify the most effective subset of tools. Alg. <a href="#alg1" title="Algorithm 1 ‣ A.2 T2Agent Pseudocode ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ T2Agent: A Tool-augmented Multimodal Misinformation Detection Agent with Monte Carlo Tree Search" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> presents the pseudocode of the tool selection mechanism. In practice, we select a subset (100 samples) of all data samples for evaluation function <math id="A1.SS2.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>f</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f</annotation></semantics></math> to save time.</p>
</div>
<figure id="alg2" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 2</span> </span> Tool selection </figcaption>
<div id="alg2.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_minipage ltx_align_center ltx_align_middle ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing" style="width:310.5pt;">
<div id="algx2.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
              
              
            <span id="algx2.l1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Initial tool set </span><math id="algx2.l1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D_{\text{base}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">D</mi><mtext mathsize="0.900em">base</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D_{\text{base}}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="algx2.l1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">, evaluation function </span><math id="algx2.l1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f()" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f()</annotation></semantics></math><span id="algx2.l1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">, number of iterations </span><math id="algx2.l1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="I" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathsize="0.900em">I</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">I</annotation></semantics></math><span id="algx2.l1.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
</span>
</div>
<div id="algx2.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
              
              
            <span id="algx2.l2.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Initialize observation data </span><math id="algx2.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{D}=\{(D_{\text{base}},f(D_{\text{base}}))\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">𝒟</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">D</mi><mtext mathsize="0.900em">base</mtext></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">D</mi><mtext mathsize="0.900em">base</mtext></msub><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{D}=\{(D_{\text{base}},f(D_{\text{base}}))\}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="algx2.l2.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
</span>
</div>
<div id="algx2.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
              
              
            <span id="algx2.l3.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Construct Gaussian Process (GP) model with chosen kernel and train it on </span><math id="algx2.l3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{D}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">𝒟</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{D}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="algx2.l3.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
</span>
</div>
<div id="algx2.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
              
              
            <span id="algx2.l4.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">for</span><span id="algx2.l4.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><math id="algx2.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\leftarrow 1,\dots,I" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">i</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></mrow><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em" mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\leftarrow 1,\dots,I</annotation></semantics></math><span id="algx2.l4.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="algx2.l4.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">do</span><span id="algx2.l4.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
</span>
</div>
<div id="algx2.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
              
              
            <span id="algx2.l5.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  Define Expected Improvement (EI) acquisition function based on current GP model
</span>
</div>
<div id="algx2.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
              
              
            <span id="algx2.l6.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  Optimize EI to find next candidate subset </span><math id="algx2.l6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D_{\text{next}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">D</mi><mtext mathsize="0.900em">next</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D_{\text{next}}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="algx2.l6.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
</span>
</div>
<div id="algx2.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
              
              
            <span id="algx2.l7.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  Evaluate </span><math id="algx2.l7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f(D_{\text{next}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">D</mi><mtext mathsize="0.900em">next</mtext></msub><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f(D_{\text{next}})</annotation></semantics></math><span id="algx2.l7.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> using the evaluation function
</span>
</div>
<div id="algx2.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
              
              
            <span id="algx2.l8.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  Add </span><math id="algx2.l8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(D_{\text{next}},f(D_{\text{next}}))" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">D</mi><mtext mathsize="0.900em">next</mtext></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em">,</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">D</mi><mtext mathsize="0.900em">next</mtext></msub><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(D_{\text{next}},f(D_{\text{next}}))</annotation></semantics></math><span id="algx2.l8.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> to </span><math id="algx2.l8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{D}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">𝒟</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{D}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="algx2.l8.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
</span>
</div>
<div id="algx2.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
              
              
            <span id="algx2.l9.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">  Retrain or update GP model parameters on updated </span><math id="algx2.l9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{D}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">𝒟</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{D}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="algx2.l9.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
</span>
</div>
<div id="algx2.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
              
              
            <span id="algx2.l10.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">end</span><span id="algx2.l10.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;"> </span><span id="algx2.l10.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">for</span>
</div>
<div id="algx2.l11" class="ltx_listingline">
              
              
            <span id="algx2.l11.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Return the best observed subset </span><math id="algx2.l11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D^{*}=\arg\max_{D\in\mathcal{D}}f(D)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi mathsize="0.900em">D</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">∗</mo></msup><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">arg</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">max</mi><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">D</mi><mo mathsize="0.900em">∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">𝒟</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">D</mi><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D^{*}=\arg\max_{D\in\mathcal{D}}f(D)</annotation></semantics></math><span id="algx2.l11.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
</span>
</div>
</div>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.3 </span>Experiment Details</h3>

<div id="A1.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In our implementation, we set the number of sampled nodes to <math id="A1.SS3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n=2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n=2</annotation></semantics></math> and the exploration weight to <math id="A1.SS3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C=2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C=2</annotation></semantics></math>. Additionally, the hyperparameter <math id="A1.SS3.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha=0.5" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha=0.5</annotation></semantics></math> is used to balance the reasoning trajectory score and the result confidence score in the evaluation.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.4 </span>More Results</h3>

<div id="A1.SS4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We also conduct additional evaluation of our method against the MMD-agent on the AMG dataset.
As shown in Table <a href="#A1.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ A.4 More Results ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ T2Agent: A Tool-augmented Multimodal Misinformation Detection Agent with Monte Carlo Tree Search" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>, our approach consistently outperforms the MMD-agent across all model sizes. In terms of F1 score, our method achieves improvements of 38.6%, 38.6%, and 39.7% over the MMD-agent when using GPT-4.1-nano, GPT-4o-mini, and GPT-4o, respectively.
The superior performance of our method can be attributed to its ability to handle the complexity of the AMG dataset, which contains five forgery sources. The MMD-Agent adopts a sequential decision-making strategy, which tends to suffer from error propagation. This means that incorrect judgments made at earlier stages affect subsequent decisions, leading to a degradation in overall performance.
In contrast, our approach explores a more balanced and holistic strategy by incorporating MCTS into the decision process. This allows our model to better assess the likelihood of each forgery type and avoid premature or biased decisions.</p>
</div>
